 由小事想到的\n\n作者：新乡/赵爱利\n\n小唐是我一个旧同事，前一段她家的电视机被她淘气的儿子不小心推到地上，当时就图像，声音全无。去一家家电器维修部看了看，维修费要一百元多，小唐就问我有没有熟人会修电视，我就告诉她胖东来电器售后电话。几天后，小唐兴高彩烈地告诉我电视修好了，洗衣机修好了，热水器修好了，没花一分钱，把我弄得懵懵的。原来胖东来售后到她家一检查电视，是电视里面的线路摔断了，焊接了一下就修好了。小唐问多少钱，售后工作人员说不收费。小唐真是有点不相信，第二天，她又打售后电话，说她们家洗衣机脱水缸坏了，售后去了又免费修好了。第三天，她又打售后电话，说她们家热水器不打火了，售后去了又免费修好了。小唐现在是胖东来的忠实顾客加义务宣传员，他无论到那里都说胖东来是“雷锋之家”。我听到之后总是欣慰的微笑，同时对企业也充满了深深的感恩与爱。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_181_748_971_1262.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"66%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1000_611_1137_725.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"11%\" /></div>\n\n\n## “小红鱼”的故事", "images": {"imgs/img_in_header_image_box_839_134_1084_254.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//ad4f9d2c-5bc6-4c56-8f2d-fda6f410196d/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_header_image_box_839_134_1084_254.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A16%3A14Z%2F-1%2F%2Ff4df3c5e5bee18d734f95c87327e5e6e26cc1a903fa3ebf3e839a016dd844d94", "imgs/img_in_image_box_181_748_971_1262.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//ad4f9d2c-5bc6-4c56-8f2d-fda6f410196d/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_181_748_971_1262.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A16%3A14Z%2F-1%2F%2Fdc8eea3e1017f8b9314586909c1c412eab2bb0f4905c92b91c0ef8be66a966d5", "imgs/img_in_image_box_1000_611_1137_725.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//ad4f9d2c-5bc6-4c56-8f2d-fda6f410196d/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_1000_611_1137_725.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A16%3A14Z%2F-1%2F%2Fa5f8f723a6c7d1f531d55c7447177341feb6d535123babc08f1183fd5e6dadcf"}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//ad4f9d2c-5bc6-4c56-8f2d-fda6f410196d/layout_det_